{"answer": "C", "estimate": 16, "mechanism": "A", "confidence": 95, "reasoning": "Go goroutines start with a 2 KB stack. Because stack allocations double (2 KB, 4 KB, 8 KB, 16 KB) and an 8192-byte array plus frame overhead and stack guard exceeds 8 KB, the runtime allocates a 16 KB stack."}
